**NEWS | Brand partnership** <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">新闻｜品牌合作</div></details>

# THE FUTURE OF CURRY BRAND <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">Curry Brand 的未来</div></details>

*The next stage is set.* <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">下一阶段，已经就位。</div></details>

This is bigger than a shoe deal. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">这件事不只是一次球鞋合同。</div></details>

Bigger than a signature series. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">也不只是推出一个个人签名系列。</div></details>

*This* is the partnership of a lifetime. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">这是一段足以影响整个职业生涯、乃至品牌未来的伙伴关系。</div></details>

The future of Curry Brand is with Li-Ning. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">Curry Brand 的未来，将与李宁同行。</div></details>

![[Attachments/curry-brand-li-ning-01.webp]]

I couldn’t be more proud to build a long-term vision with Li-Ning that will fuel Curry Brand for years to come and unlock the full potential of this company on a global scale. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">能够与李宁一起构建一套长期愿景，我感到无比自豪。这套愿景将在未来多年推动 Curry Brand 发展，并在全球范围内释放这家公司真正的潜力。</div></details>

Powered by Li-Ning innovation, we’ll be proudly building Curry Brand into a future leading company that will leave its mark in Basketball, in Golf and across the lifestyle space. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">借助李宁的创新能力，我们将自豪地把 Curry Brand 打造成一家面向未来的领先公司，在篮球、高尔夫以及生活方式领域留下自己的印记。</div></details>

We’ll aim to create game-changing products, launch elevated platforms and bring storytelling that will inspire young boys and girls around the globe. My hope is for young athletes to find the same purpose, joy and drive through sports that I’ve long enjoyed throughout this journey. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">我们的目标，是打造改变比赛体验的产品，推出更高层次的平台，并讲述能够激励全球年轻男孩女孩的故事。我希望年轻运动员能通过体育找到目标、快乐和动力，就像我一路走来所感受到的那样。</div></details>

![[Attachments/curry-brand-li-ning-02.webp]]

> #### “It’s amazing to see how Chairman Li Ning has grown his namesake company as an athlete founder.” <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">“看到李宁主席以运动员创始人的身份，把以自己名字命名的公司发展到今天，真的令人惊叹。”</div></details>

What also excites me is knowing that there’s a foundation of like-minded athletes that have helped to build Li-Ning into a world-class brand since it began in 1990. That starts with Mr. Li Ning himself. He’s an Olympic Gold medalist athlete, forward thinking businessman, and visionary that I really respect and believe in. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">同样让我兴奋的是，自 1990 年创立以来，李宁背后一直有一群理念相近的运动员，共同把它建设成世界级品牌。而这一切首先要从李宁先生本人说起。他是奥运金牌运动员，也是有前瞻性的商业人士和愿景型领导者，我非常尊重他，也相信他。</div></details>

It’s amazing to see how he’s grown his namesake company as an athlete founder, knowing I have those same hopes and aspirations for Curry Brand. Now, we’ll be working together to continually elevate both brands for the long run. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">看到他以运动员创始人的身份，将这家以自己名字命名的公司发展起来，令人惊叹；而我对 Curry Brand 也怀有同样的期待和抱负。现在，我们将携手合作，在长期维度上不断提升两个品牌。</div></details>

Throughout my sneaker free agency, I was impressed by the quality, comfort and performance of Li-Ning’s shoes. It was during that time playing in Dwyane Wade and Jimmy Butler’s sneakers, that I knew that Li-Ning could be the right partner that can deliver on the innovation and design that I want Curry Brand to stand for. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">在我的球鞋“自由市场”期间，李宁球鞋的品质、舒适度和性能给我留下了深刻印象。也正是在那段时间，我穿着德怀恩·韦德和吉米·巴特勒的签名鞋比赛，由此意识到：李宁可能正是那个合适的伙伴，能够实现我希望 Curry Brand 所代表的创新与设计。</div></details>

![[Attachments/curry-brand-li-ning-03.webp]]

We’re already having tons of great conversations about how we can introduce Li-Ning’s level of innovation to more and more hoopers here in the US, that will help players of all levels elevate their game. More than anything, I want people to expect amazing design, quality and performance every time they lace up a Curry Brand sneaker. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">我们已经进行了许多很棒的讨论，思考如何把李宁这一水准的创新带给美国越来越多的篮球玩家，帮助各个水平的球员提升表现。最重要的是，我希望人们每次系上 Curry Brand 球鞋时，都能期待出色的设计、品质和性能。</div></details>

Throughout this process, there were a few major key factors I was looking for. I wanted Curry Brand to be powered by a company that is truly about sport. A company that is committed to celebrating basketball around the world — now and in the future. I wanted to partner with a company that I believed in, from a product standpoint of course, but from a people standpoint most importantly. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">在整个过程中，我一直在寻找几个关键条件。我希望 Curry Brand 背后站着一家真正以运动为核心的公司；一家现在和未来都致力于在全球范围内礼赞篮球的公司。我想合作的，是一家我真正相信的公司——当然要从产品层面相信它，但更重要的是，我要从“人”的层面相信它。</div></details>

With Li-Ning, I’ve found that. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">在李宁身上，我找到了这些。</div></details>

> #### “Throughout my sneaker free agency, I was impressed by the quality, comfort and performance of Li-Ning’s shoes.” <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">“在我的球鞋自由市场期间，李宁球鞋的品质、舒适度和性能给我留下了深刻印象。”</div></details>

![[Attachments/curry-brand-li-ning-04.webp]]

> #### “Curry Brand will now have an expanded runway of resources and a global footprint to bring new best-in-class innovations and amazing products to people around the world.” <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">“现在，Curry Brand 将拥有更广阔的资源 runway 和全球化版图，把同类最佳的新创新和出色产品带给世界各地的人们。”</div></details>

At the end of the day, I truly believe that partnering with Li-Ning will allow Curry Brand to thrive. Li-Ning is a total sports brand, and it’s also the basketball market share leader in China. The brand has over 7,600 stores throughout Asia. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">归根到底，我真心相信，与李宁合作会让 Curry Brand 蓬勃发展。李宁是一个完整的综合体育品牌，也是中国篮球市场份额的领先者。这个品牌在亚洲拥有超过 7600 家门店。</div></details>

I consider it a proud privilege to be able to use my platform to help Mr. Li Ning and his teams bring their innovation to the US. A company this dedicated to sport and athletes with such quality product and innovation deserves an even bigger stage. We have plans to launch Curry Brand stores together in China and the US, as we look to build on the success that Li-Ning has already established, with even more growth. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">能够利用我的平台，帮助李宁先生和他的团队把他们的创新带到美国，我认为这是一份值得骄傲的荣幸。一家如此投入于运动和运动员、又拥有如此高质量产品与创新能力的公司，理应站上更大的舞台。我们计划在中国和美国共同开设 Curry Brand 门店，在李宁既有成功基础上继续实现更大的增长。</div></details>

Curry Brand will now have an expanded runway of resources and a global footprint to bring new best-in-class innovations and amazing products to people around the world. Just as importantly, Curry Brand will be able to impactfully reach the next generation of athletes and provide access and experiences that will continue to Change The Game For Good. <details class="translation-details"><summary>中文译文</summary><div class="translation-body">现在，Curry Brand 将获得更充足的资源跑道和全球化足迹，把同类最佳的新创新与出色产品带给世界各地的人们。同样重要的是，Curry Brand 将能更有影响力地触达下一代运动员，为他们提供机会和体验，继续以积极方式改变这项运动。</div></details>

